0087-glm-port-stage2-routes: TensorFold v0.6.5 compatibility.
Preserve GLM route guards and seed salt; keep upstream asymmetric NCCL exchange (c3d92bb) alongside the optional symmetric copy-engine transport.

diff --git tensorfold/cuda/comm.py tensorfold/cuda/comm.py
